The bundled browser reviewer uses published React, React DOM, Scheduler,
DOMPurify, quiht-core and lucide-react. Their license texts are included in
vexy_localizzy/review/web/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt and review/public/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt.

Parts of this package are adapted from an earlier MIT-licensed localization
toolkit whose project metadata identifies FontLab as author: the canonical
catalog compatibility types and key/placeholder helpers in
src/vexy_localizzy/catalog.py; filename planning in
src/vexy_localizzy/memory/names.py; literal-token QA contracts in
src/vexy_localizzy/qa/tokens.py; the compatibility, plural/device and Fluent
projections and the legacy converters in src/vexy_localizzy/extract/; the Qt
source scanner, lupdate/lrelease wrappers and app launcher in
src/vexy_localizzy/qt/; pseudo-localization in src/vexy_localizzy/pseudo.py;
the vocabulary corpus reader in src/vexy_localizzy/vocab.py and the example
corpus in examples/vocabulary/; the findings renderers in
src/vexy_localizzy/report.py; tool discovery in src/vexy_localizzy/external.py
and src/vexy_localizzy/doctor.py; plural tables in src/vexy_localizzy/plurals.py;
project configuration in src/vexy_localizzy/project.py and
src/vexy_localizzy/cli/project.py; the optional QA layers in
src/vexy_localizzy/qa/layers.py; the review workspace import in
src/vexy_localizzy/review/workspace.py; and the memory lookup in
src/vexy_localizzy/memory/lookup.py and lookup.html.

